{"id":"f12377a238966b6a","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-forgetful.md","title":"Forgetful Functor","display":"df-forgetful — Forgetful Functor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-forgetful","aliases":["58-df-forgetful","Forgetful Functor"],"display":"df-forgetful — Forgetful Functor","depends_on":["[[58-df-functor]]","[[58-df-category-theory]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-forgetful"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-forgetful</span><span>Forgetful Functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-forgetful — Forgetful Functor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"58-df-functor\">58-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"58-df-category-theory\">58-df-category-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"77af8d422f1b33a0\" href=\"?note=77af8d422f1b33a0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor\">58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> (concrete category)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}\">\\(U:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}\\)</span> (candidate underlying-set functor)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S(U,\\mathcal C,\\mathbf{Set})\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S(U,\\mathcal C,\\mathbf{Set})\\)</span> (faithful-functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"77af8d422f1b33a0\" href=\"?note=77af8d422f1b33a0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor\">58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Forgetful}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Forgetful}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (forgetful-functor predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}forgetful} \\vdash \\mathrm{Forgetful}_S(U,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S(U,\\mathcal C,\\mathbf{Set})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}forgetful} \\vdash \\mathrm{Forgetful}_S(U,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S(U,\\mathcal C,\\mathbf{Set})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A forgetful functor exhibits <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> as a concrete category by faithfully mapping it to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Free functor: left adjoint to forgetful; creates free objects from sets</li>\n<li>Adjunction: free-group on set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(X)\">\\(F(X)\\)</span> with universal property</li>\n<li>Topological forgetful: Top <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span> Set; loses openness/continuity</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mac Lane, Categories for the Working Mathematician</li>\n<li>Awodey, Category Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category-theory","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-category-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor","status":"resolved","id":"77af8d422f1b33a0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor","status":"resolved","id":"77af8d422f1b33a0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S(U,\\mathcal C,\\mathbf{Set})$ (faithful-functor predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"U:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S(U,\\mathcal C,\\mathbf{Set})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Forgetful}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}forgetful} \\vdash \\mathrm{Forgetful}_S(U,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S(U,\\mathcal C,\\mathbf{Set})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"F(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\to","display":false}],"bytes":1248,"backlinks":[{"id":"797ed4ec0ca2a08f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Forgetful}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (forgetful-functor predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md]])"},{"id":"f0b0fd432c3af58f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U:\\mathbf{Grp}\\to\\mathbf{Set}$ (forgetful functor, see [[../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-543","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md|58-df-forgetful]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["877f1061e295cf5f","8790486ac053461c","77af8d422f1b33a0"]}